Truths (limit=None):
[
    "RAG的发展可以分为三个主要阶段: 原始RAG (Naive RAG)、高级RAG (Advanced RAG)和模块化RAG (Modular RAG)。",
    "每个阶段 of RAG development aims to improve the model's performance and applicability.",
    "原始RAG is a basic form of RAG technology in its early stage of development.",
    "原始RAG combines retrieval and generation steps in a relatively simple and direct way to enhance language model output.",
    "The architecture and workflow of Naive RAG are relatively simple, making it easy to understand and implement.",
    "Naive RAG serves as the starting point of RAG technology.",
    "The quality of answers generated by Naive RAG heavily depends on the effectiveness of the retrieval phase.",
    "If the retrieved text chunks are not sufficiently relevant to the query, the quality of the generated answer may decrease in Naive RAG.",
    "Redundant content may appear in answers generated by Naive RAG if multiple retrieved text chunks contain similar or duplicate information.",
    "Despite its limitations, Naive RAG laid the foundation for the development of more advanced RAG technologies.",
    "Naive RAG’s simplicity gives it practical value in certain application scenarios.",
    "高级RAG is a more advanced RAG paradigm developed based on Naive RAG.",
    "高级RAG introduces more complex strategies and techniques to optimize the retrieval and generation processes to improve overall performance and output quality.",
    "高级RAG optimizes the indexing phase, possibly using finer-grained text chunking such as sentence- or phrase-level segmentation to improve retrieval precision.",
    "高级RAG may rewrite or expand user queries before retrieval to better match content in the document corpus.",
    "高级RAG significantly improves RAG technology’s performance and application scope through various advanced techniques and strategies.",
    "高级RAG makes RAG more effective and reliable in complex natural language processing tasks.",
    "高级RAG continues to evolve with ongoing research to address more challenges and requirements.",
    "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is an emerging technical paradigm that has received widespread attention and research.",
    "The article titled '大模型检索增强生成(RAG)技术浅析' is authored by Zhao Jing, Tang Wenyu, Huo Yu, Fu Jin Feifei, and Qiao Zhiqi from State Grid Siji Cybersecurity Technology (Beijing) Co., Ltd.",
    "The article discusses the basic concepts, architectural design, applications, advantages, development history, and future research directions of RAG technology."
] 

